<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-τίλλω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῐλῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					123
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέτῑλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					686
				</span></i>
			:— <i>pluck, pull out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τρίχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἀποτίλας</span> without
				<i>pulling off</i> any of the fur, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.123
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pull the hair off, pluck bare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς κεφαλάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					578
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτιλῶ σε τήμερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτετιλμένος σκάφιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					806
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				724
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a fish, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαπέρδην ἀποτῖλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					686
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
